  "response_to_critic": "Addressed the critical issue raised by CommonSenseAgent and confirmed by ValidatorAgent: (1) Updated target from [5,1,6] to [0,1,8] to match the final scene design where the lectern is placed at /setblock ~0 ~1 ~8. (2) Reduced max_distance from 8 to 4 to prevent trivial completion from spawn. The lectern is exactly 8 blocks from spawn, so max_distance=8 would have allowed passing without movement. With max_distance=4, the agent must walk at least 4 blocks forward (to z≈4+), placing them at or inside the building doorway (z=5) with clear line of sight to the lectern. Verified: spawn→lectern = 8.0 blocks (FAILS check, good), doorway→lectern = 3.0 blocks (PASSES check, good).",
